WEBVTT

51:30.203 --> 51:32.621
-Hi!
-Everyone! It's Woody!

51:32.706 --> 51:33.706
-Woody?
-You're kidding!

51:33.790 --> 51:36.917
-Woody?
-We're gonna get outta here, Buzz.

51:37.419 --> 51:38.627
Buzz?

51:43.467 --> 51:45.092
-Hey, look!
-Woody!

51:45.177 --> 51:47.303
Oh, boy, am I glad
to see you guys.

51:47.387 --> 51:50.055
-I knew you'd come back, Woody.
-What are you doin' over there?

51:50.140 --> 51:52.600
It's a long story, Bo.
I'll explain later.

51:52.684 --> 51:54.685
Here! Catch this!

51:55.812 --> 51:58.272
-Whoa! I've got it, Woody.
-He got it, Woody.

51:58.356 --> 52:01.233
Good goin', Slink. Nowjust,
just tie it on to somethin'.
